      "cooked": "<p>Yeah it makes sense. And not every scion will come out, but it gives variety between games. This update gives me just enough, and I'm pretty excited about it &nbsp;can't wait to see what the last stretch goal is &nbsp;</p><p>So together we have&nbsp;</p><p>[quote]</p><p><b>Decks:</b></p><ul>\n<li>25 card OblivAeon Deck</li>\n<li>25 card Aeon Men Deck</li>\n<li>25 card Scion Deck</li>\n<li>25 card Mission Deck (this was originally 10 cards, but we added 15 more because we had additional awesome ideas)*</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p>",
